  "experiment_id": "v2_exp005_command_tcn_tuned",
  "description": "Prospectively tuned command-aware non-graph TCN control. Uses the same command histories that feed telemetry node 0 in EXP002, but fuses them directly in a causal TCN rather than by graph message passing.",
